WEBVTT

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:17.940
<i>Peter-kun!</i>

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.510
<i>Peter-kun?</i>

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:20.560
<i>Peter-kun...!</i>

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:27.300
<i>Forgive me, Luvelia-senpai!</i>

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:39.030
The chance to be a hero is long gone...

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:45.080
Dug myself into a hole with no way out

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:49.590
Back against the wall...

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.420
I mean, how could I resist?

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.130
"This wasn't supposed to happen,"

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:54.720
I keep denying

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.180
I wish I could just disappear...

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:57.340
I wish I could just disappear...

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:57.840
I wish I could just disappear...

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.810
I can't stand myself

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:04.230
Moping around, spouting lies, grieving a broken heart

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:07.190
I hold on desperately to these feelings and shut my eyes

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:10.650
So why does this stupid guilt refuse to go away!?

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:10.650
So why does this stupid guilt refuse to go away!?

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:14.280
I suffocate under its weight

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:18.200
The chance to be a hero is long gone...

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:21.620
Always discouraged by my weaknesses,

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:24.830
I drop to my knees and grovel at your feet,

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:27.830
clinging selfishly to the hope for forgiveness

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:31.170
Dug myself into a hole with no way out...

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.420
Full of regret and powerless to change,

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:37.680
I feel my heart being torn apart

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:41.430
on this night of endless shame and despair

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:50.650
Why can't I get my act together?

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:56.780
Got nothing but this pathetic self of mine...

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:05.450
Episode\h     Peter Grill and the Treaty's Aftermath

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:04.070
<i>Our first date in ages, just the two of us...</i>

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:05.780
<i>How could I let this happen...?</i>

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:11.140
Sir Peter...

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:14.000
P-Piglette!

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.070
What, uh...

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:17.170
brings you he–

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:28.880
I finished preparing dinner,
and I've been awaiting your return...

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:30.420
J-Just checking, but...

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.230
You do know what a "rest day" is, right...?

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:34.500
Huh?

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.120
Wh-Why, of course!

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:39.190
I am aware of the implications!

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:41.080
G-Good...

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:43.250
That's a relief...

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:46.140
Um...

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:48.980
If you'd like...

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:50.460
Shall I wash your back for you?

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:02.180
Is something the matter, Sir Peter?

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:05.680
I'm the biggest scumbag on the planet...

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:10.730
Today was my special date with Luvellia-senpai...

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:11.430
And yet...

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:17.400
I went behind her back 
and did all sorts of despicable things...!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.530
My heart breaks for you, Sir Peter...

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:27.490
You must've gone through a dreadful ordeal.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:31.290
But please... try to put your mind at ease.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:36.500
Unlike the others,
I would never do anything to cause you pain.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.500
Piglette...?

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:41.360
So, for right now...

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:44.510
Let your feelings out on me.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:46.220
I don't mind one bit.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.270
I accept you for who you are,

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:56.650
regardless of your flaws!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.700
<i>N-Not again...!</i>

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:12.580
<i>They're pulling me in...</i>

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:13.700
<i>I can't hold out much long–</i>

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:24.550
<i>There goes the treaty...</i>

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.050
Oh dear...

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:27.770
How distasteful...

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:32.980
Such a shameless violation of the treaty...

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:33.960
Lisa!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:38.660
"Farm animal" is an appropriate title

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:40.660
for an Orc such as her...

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:43.060
Can't take your eyes off her for a second, huh?

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:46.190
W... Wait a minute–!

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:51.440
With all due respect,

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:56.130
the three of you are the ones
intruding upon Sir Peter's personal time in broad daylight!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.870
You're in no position to criticize me!

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:01.300
D-Did the dimwitted Orc...

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.550
anticipate us gettin' the jump on each other...!?

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.760
I knew it...

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:08.720
This woman is not to be trifled with.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:10.930
U-Unbelievable...

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:12.930
They ignored the rules...

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:14.850
Despite cheating the system...

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.690
They refuse to take responsibility,

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:20.190
and now they're trying to
pin the blame on each other!?

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:22.860
Well then...

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:25.300
Given the extenuating circumstances...

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.620
There's only one way outta this mess, huh?

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:29.820
In accordance with the guidelines...

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:33.280
We shall share his fluids equally...!

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:01.510
<i>Why me...?</i>

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:06.700
<i>Why does this keep happening!?</i>

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:10.100
Does "rest day" mean nothing to you!?

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:11.280
What about the treaty!?

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.550
At this rate, it's nothing more than

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:16.660
<i>a worthless piece of paper!</i>

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:24.620
Well, he might have a point.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:26.200
Indeed.

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:27.880
This poses a serious problem.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:30.500
M-My sincerest apologies.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:31.140
However...

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:34.380
Y'see, the thing is...

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:35.950
Even if we break the rules,

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.720
the treaty doesn't exactly specify any kind of punishment.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:47.480
<i>Wait...</i>

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:50.490
<i>Then that means...</i>

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:56.120
<i>I've reached the point of no return
in every possible way...!</i>

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:02.420
Senpai!?

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.390
<i>I'm done...</i>

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:15.800
<i>No more...</i>

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:18.010
<i>I've had enough of this madness...!</i>

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:19.220
<i>I know!</i>

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:21.210
<i>I should run away from home!</i>

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:23.810
<i>Somewhere far, far away...</i>

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:27.780
<i>I'll put an end to it once and for all...!</i>

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.410
<i>Goodbye forever,</i>

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:45.770
<i>Luvellia-senpai...!</i>

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:48.860
On that day, Peter Grill,

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:51.190
the strongest man in the world...

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:53.340
cast aside everything and fled.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:59.180
Alas, misfortune struck...

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.890
In his fragile mental state,

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:05.390
Peter found himself unable to
abandon the life he had come to know.

00:08:05.390 --> 00:08:08.480
<i>I can't bring myself to throw it all away...</i>

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:12.060
<i>I can't bear to leave my relationship
with Luvellia-senpai behind...!</i>

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:24.150
The rain has chosen 
an inopportune moment to fall upon us.

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:27.620
<i>H-He's an Ogre...</i>

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:34.800
If you are so inclined, please use this.

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:37.720
Th-Thank you very much...

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:41.660
It would seem you have suffered a great tragedy.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.180
Well...

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.900
It's an embarrassing story...

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:49.210
I shall lend an ear, if you wish.

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:57.100
To be honest, I've made a terrible mistake...

00:08:57.690 --> 00:08:59.260
Many, many times...

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:02.910
At this point,
I probably oughtta suck it up and walk away.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:04.370
But...

00:09:05.610 --> 00:09:09.500
No matter what I do,
I can't get her out of my head...

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:13.380
Love is beyond our control.

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:16.670
I understand how you feel.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.660
As fate would have it,

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:23.440
I just arrived in this town as part of my search 
for the woman who stole my heart.

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:26.290
The woman who stole your heart...?

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:27.780
Three years...

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:32.980
Three years I've been journeying across the land,
leaving no stone unturned in a quest to find her...

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:35.940
<i>He knows what it's like to fall
head-over-heels for someone...!</i>

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:38.660
At last, I secured a lead.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:43.190
Supposedly, she has become a member of
the Yakeppachi Warriors Guild located in this town.

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:44.950
<i>Did he say...!?</i>

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:48.690
While I am unfamiliar
with the details of your situation,

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:50.460
you mustn't let fear consume you.

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:53.460
If your love is genuine,

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:57.220
then I am confident that the gods
shall light your path with their blessings.

00:09:58.840 --> 00:10:02.210
<i>He has such kindness and compassion 
for a total stranger...</i>

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:05.220
<i>This Ogre is the definition of "wholesome"!</i>

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:08.090
Thank you!

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:09.500
I won't give up!

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:13.490
No matter what the future holds... I'll see it through.

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:17.360
Luvellia-senpai and I 
are gonna find our happily-ever-after!

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:22.620
It seems the rain has let up...

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:26.120
I shall take my leave accordingly.

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:29.090
Talk about a coincidence...

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:32.870
You see, I'm a member of the
Yakeppachi Warriors Guild myself.

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:34.210
Uh...

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:36.880
May I ask the name 
of the woman who stole your heart...?

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.020
Of course.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:44.610
She is known to the people of Ogrestan
as both our strongest warrior and Princess Royal:

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:49.600
I have travelled here in pursuit of Lady Lisa Alpacas.

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:52.060
Is something the matter?

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:55.560
<i>Lisa...</i>

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:57.560
<i>Alpacas...</i>

00:10:57.560 --> 00:11:00.030
<i>is a </i>princess!?<i></i>

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:03.160
It started out as a simple crush

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:06.200
Suddenly, you were my biggest source of strength

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.830
Till death do us part, let's grow old together

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:12.080
This is my sincerest wish:

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.170
Stay with me, stay with me

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:17.840
So long time, by my side for all eternity

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:21.050
Beaten down by our daily struggles

00:11:21.050 --> 00:11:23.470
Or soaked by a storm of rage;

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:26.430
If you get drenched, I won't hesitate

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:28.810
To be the umbrella that shields you

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:31.520
It's not so cold... I'm by your side

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:33.980
That's good enough for me

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:37.150
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:41.030
That smile of yours puts my soul at ease

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:43.450
I could search the whole world over

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:45.530
And find no one like you

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:48.540
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:52.500
Just the sight of you fills my heart with joy

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.710
No matter how much it may hurt,

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:57.750
I pledge my life to protecting you

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.700
Dear Sir Peter Grill,

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:07.260
A little birdie told me that things are gettin'
precarious in the Ogres' neck of the woods.

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:10.020
Episode     Peter Grill and the Angry Megaton Axe

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.020
Y'think something bad happened...?
